    264  09fe							;------------------------------------------------------------- interrupts
    265  09fe							; Every 1/4 ms: take a MIDI-in byte, feed the ACIA one byte (fast path).
    266  09fe							; Every fourth time (1 ms):
    267  09fe							; count a tick and move paced messages onto the wire.
