    171  0df1							; A = key code
    172  0df1							;   overlay	    notes (K held + a note: set the key)
    173  0df1							;   F1/F3/F5/F7    octave: C4 / C3 / C2 / C1 on the lowest key
    174  0df1							;   SHIFT+F1/F3/F5 SID / Game Boy / MidiNES on-off	SHIFT+F7 panic
    175  0df1							;   CTRL+F3/F5     Game Boy / MidiNES: next channel block
    176  0df1							;   M		    mute everything	   SPACE  per its mode
    177  0df1							;   =		    latch: off <-> on, in the menu's LATCH STYLE
    178  0df1							;   N		    new chord: the next note starts one (twice: clear now)
    179  0df1							;   Z / X	    notes mode (POLY, CHORD, EXT) / extensions (7 9 11 13)
    180  0df1							;   K + note / L   key root / major-minor
    181  0df1							;   V / SHIFT+V    next / previous sound	    C  POLY / MONO
    182  0df1							;   G / RETURN     next beat (and drum kit) / beat start-stop
    183  0df1							;   A / S / D / F  arp mode / pattern / speed / SPARKLE octave
    184  0df1							;   ; / :	    free arp speed	      B  tap tempo
    185  0df1							;   , / .	    SPACE mode (MUTES / BENDS)
    186  0df1							;   H / J	    MIDI in octave down / up
    187  0df1							;   (the phantom-key filter stays off: GhostKey is kept for a setup menu)
