      2  4a73							; MidiNES triangle release drop: -24 semitones over 50 steps (5 ms each = 250 ms), slow at first
      3  4a73							; triPb: MidiNES triangle bend scale per MIDI note, p(n) = 1710 * 0.5^((n - 36) / 12)
